me":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[31,24,74,75,71,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[31,24,74,75,71,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[31,24,74,75,71,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[31,24,74,75,71,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[31,24,74,75,71,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10957","city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[31,24,74,75,71,73],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年官员，名士法真之子，蜀汉谋主法正之父。出身名门，凭借家世与才学被举荐为孝廉，由此步入仕途。官至司徒掾、廷尉左监。司徒掾是司徒（三公之一）的重要属官，参与国家政务的处理；廷尉左监则是廷尉（九卿之一，最高司法长官）的副手，负责刑狱事务。早年在京为官，善待后进，曾点拨尚微时的刘焉，刘家感念其恩德。汉末关中大乱前去世，其子法正远赴益州依附刘璋。","tc":"東漢末年官員，名士法真之子，蜀漢謀主法正之父。出身名門，憑借家世與才學被舉薦為孝廉，由此步入仕途。官至司徒掾、廷尉左監。司徒掾是司徒（三公之一）的重要屬官，參與國家政務的處理；廷尉左監則是廷尉（九卿之一，最高司法長官）的副手，負責刑獄事務。早年在京為官，善待后進，曾點撥尚微時的劉焉，劉家感念其恩德。漢末關中大亂前去世，其子法正遠赴益州依附劉璋。","en":"An official of the late Eastern Han dynasty, son of the esteemed scholar Fa Zhen and father of the Shu strategist Fa Zheng. Born to an illustrious family, he was recommended as Filial and Incorruptible based on his family background and learning, thus entering officialdom. He served as Clerk to the Minister over the Masses and Left Supervisor of the Commandant of Justice. As a key aide to the Minister over the Masses (one of the Three Excellencies), he assisted in state affairs, as deputy to the Commandant of Justice (one of the Nine Ministers and chief judicial officer), he oversaw penal matters. During his early years serving in the capital, he nurtured younger talents and once mentored Liu Yan when Liu was still obscure, earning the Liu family's lasting gratitude. He passed away before the great chaos engulfed the Guanzhong region, after which his son Fa Zheng traveled to Yi Province to serve Liu Zhang.","jp":"後漢末期の官吏。名士・法真の子であり、蜀漢の謀主・法正の父。名門の出身で、家柄と才学によって孝廉に推挙され、官途に就いた。官職は司徒掾、廷尉左監に至った。司徒掾は司徒（三公の一つ）の重要な属官であり、国政の処理に携わった。廷尉左監は廷尉（九卿の一つ、最高司法長官）の補佐役として、刑獄の事務を司った。若くして都で仕官していた頃は後進によく目をかけ、まだ微賤であった劉焉を教え導いたことから、劉家はその恩徳を深く感じていた。漢末の関中の大乱以前に没し、子の法正は遠く益州へと赴いて劉璋を頼ることとなる。","kr":"동한 말기의 관료로, 명사 법진의 아들이자 촉한의 모주 법정의 아버지입니다. 명문가 출신으로, 가문과 재학(才學)을 인정받아 효렴으로 천거되며 출사했습니다. 관직은 사도연, 정위좌감에 이르렀습니다. 사도연은 삼공 중 하나인 사도의 주요 속관으로서 국가 정무 처리에 참여하였고, 정위좌감은 구경 중 하나이자 최고 사법 장관인 정위의 부관으로 형옥 사무를 관장했습니다. 젊은 시절 수도에서 관직에 있을 때 후진을 후대하였으며, 아직 지위가 미미하던 시절의 유언을 이끌어 주어 유씨 가문에서 그 은덕을 깊이 감사히 여겼습니다. 한말 관중의 대란이 일어나기 전에 세상을 떠났으며, 아들 법정은 멀리 익주로 가 유장에게 의탁했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1031215","remark":"","surname":"法","surnameTc":"法","surnameEn":"Fa","surnameJp":"法","surnameKr":"법","surnameOther":"","name":"衍","nameTc":"衍","nameEn":"Yan","nameJp":"衍","nameKr":"연","nameOther":"","word":"季谋","wordTc":"季謀","wordEn":"Jimou","wordJp":"季謀","wordKr":"계모","wordOther":"","icon":"法衍","power":"WJ10173","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1030","gender":"0","rule":"31","force":"24","wise":"74","politics":"75","charm":"71","will":"73","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"15/15/43/15/15/74/55/15","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1003705","warSoulPoint":"1500","battleSoulPoint":"500","debateSoulPoint":"4900","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1005401","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/0/2/1/0/1/2/1/2/3/0/0/2/1/0/2/0/0/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"24","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"4800","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"136","show":"184","death":"195","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007202","armor":"WP1015105","helmet":"WP1026605","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"21/1;8/1;41/1;42/1;43/1;23/1;15/1;31/1;68/1","father":"WJ1031115/0","mother":"","children":"WJ10092/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10045/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"东汉末年官员，名士法真之子，蜀汉谋主法正之父。出身名门，凭借家世与才学被举荐为孝廉，由此步入仕途。官至司徒掾、廷尉左监。司徒掾是司徒（三公之一）的重要属官，参与国家政务的处理；